        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 18px;max-width:48ch;">We're the OB/GYNs, dietitians and scientists who lived the same story our customers tell us — symptoms brushed aside, labs called "normal," an appointment that ended in "it's probably stress." We built Womankind because nothing on the shelf was good enough to recommend to our patients, our friends, or ourselves.</p>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 32px;max-width:48ch;">Care designed by women who know the transition from the inside — research-led, honestly dosed, and made to meet you years before the word menopause feels like yours.</p>
